---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="OEM & Private Label"
  description="OEM and ODM manufacturing for standard and custom filter sizes, from prototyping to production."
  breadcrumbs={[{ label: 'OEM / Private Label', href: '/oem/' }]}
>
  <main class="wrap" style="padding-top:2rem;">
    <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / OEM / Private Label</nav>
    <h1>OEM &amp; Private Label</h1>

    <p class="lede">
      OEM and ODM manufacturing is supported for standard and custom sizes. The process runs from
      prototyping through to production, including filter media at low minimum order quantities.
    </p>

    <h2>What can be customised</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Dimensions</strong> — standard and custom sizes across panel, round, heavy-duty and HEPA forms.</li>
      <li><strong>Media</strong> — synthetic fibre, micro-glass, activated carbon and needle-punched media.</li>
      <li><strong>Frames and seals</strong> — aluminium, galvanised steel, stainless; gel, gasket and endless-gasket seals.</li>
      <li><strong>Efficiency grade</strong> — matched to the application from G1 through U17.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Process</h2>
    <ol>
      <li>Send a drawing, sample or OE number with target quantity.</li>
      <li>Confirm media, frame, seal and efficiency specification.</li>
      <li>Prototype approval where required.</li>
      <li>Production with pre-shipment quality check.</li>
    </ol>

    <p class="notice">
      MOQ and lead time are quoted per line. Indicative pricing is confirmed on quotation. No
      minimum-order figure is stated unless sourced from a traceable record.
    </p>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
